// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3104019502" "We need one of those lunch trucks to come by.  I'm hungry."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1665371214" "I always hate being stationed in the Pit."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1714067652" "The Hell Forge is a beautiful piece of machinery."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1190817322" "I'm impressed with what we've been able to accomplish here on Sharkhead."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3934271842" "Let's go out later. Bust some heads.  We've earned it."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1793322600" "Ten more minutes.  Just ten more minutes..."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P553885242" "These breaks are just too short.  I need time to unwind."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P947031945" "I don't get the reference.  I hate donuts."

// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3346610865" "Send these fools back to the Zig!"
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1736795455" "The time to shine is now!"
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3419110231" "See this badge?  It says I can do whatever I want!"
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1733222291" "You know what private security is, don't you?  It means I can do whatever I want."
// SHARKHEAD_BREAKTIME_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1549792256" "Pain is a great motivator.  I'm going to cause you some."

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P977504588" "I did this beat last week.  It's nothing special."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1968639331" "We've got another round to make before the next shift."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4176375963" "Keep up!"

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3719403543" "Lets get 'em, guys!"
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3938195821" "This is private property!"
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3882426289" "Let me make an introduction.  Hello, teeth? This is fist."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3870261404" "Put your hands where I can--  Aw, forget it.  Fire!"

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3749639309" "The miners are always whining and complaining."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P409082849" "I heard one of the miners complaining, something about abolishing slavery, can you believe that?"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P195237659" "Whenever I hear 'Equal work for equal pay,' I want to laugh."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1512072932" "I've heard rumors of Scrapyard's ghost; it's ridiculous."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1405553158" "The Pit is a sweltering hole of filth."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P355777054" "Forget it.  I'm not taking your shift.  I worked a double today."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1969705120" "Look, I'm not taking your shift.  I don't care if you have a date.  Do I have the words 'abuse me' written on my forehead?"

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3410717469" "Prepare to be interrogated!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_CAGE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P349796992" "There's no Miranda rights here.  Just waste 'em!"

// SHARKHEAD_CAGEPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3087447532" "Finally some action.  Get 'em, boys!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGEPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3464201949" "Go back to Mercy Island, you need more time in the gutters!"

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664704292" "All seems clear here."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1973659791" "Everything looks to be in good order."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3542215619" "Why is this notice posted upside down?"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1488590179" "A place for everything, everything in its place."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3976439638" "This here looks tampered with."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1266042161" "Hm.  This doesn't match the manifest."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2346897235" "Did I just hear something move in there?"

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P808101618" "Private property means you're not supposed to waltz in without permission!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P536430824" "You should have skulked elsewhere!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3908198805" "Your life span just got shorter!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_INSPECT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1902442556" "Take care of this!  The shipment can wait!"

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2112634722" "Move it, guys.  The cargo ship's not going to wait just because you can't get the lead out!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3212846651" "There will be no excuses.  We've gotta stay on schedule."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P38718411" "Easy with that.  If you drop it, they're going to have to clean you up with a wet-dry vac."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2211061846" "Come ON, people.  These boxes don't move themselves."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3154298054" "Okay, enough of this.  My grandmother moves faster than you guys."

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2213843154" "We've got extra dynamite, let's light this one up!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3881210825" "We keep the pickaxes sharp, just for punks like you!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1481375033" "I'll handle this one!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2677177747" "So you're saying I CAN'T throw the box at 'em?  Okay fine, I'll improvise!"

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2382594506" "Really?  I don't see what all the fuss is about."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4130041164" "No way I'm going into Potter's Field after dark.  You don't pay me THAT much."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3333557877" "Easy, sarge.  That's Cooper's assignment.  But I'll be sure to tell him."
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2993199793" "Send over the next watch."

// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P351570802" "I'm gonna need backup over here!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P503351960" "Oh now this is gonna be fun!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P534836926" "We've got company!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P159132378" "No need for reinforcements!  We like a challenge!"
// SHARKHEAD_CAGE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1812806085" "This is the most action I've seen all day!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1154730662" "We are on time with this load."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P431827279" "Yes, sir, I'll tell them.  Get to work!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3863012534" "We've got a lot to do and not a lot of time."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1141146597" "We are slightly behind schedule here."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P725320871" "Yes, sir.  That's a good plan.  I'll be sure to let them know."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2301839477" "Send in the big guns!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4006769925" "Forget reinforcements!  No time!  We'll take care of it."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P680272206" "Forget backup.  We got it!"

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3517770584" "Cage Consortium can always provide the highest quality goods."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2306903773" "Sharkhead is our territory; therefore, our contract.  We make the rules.  So I think the phrase I'm looking for is, 'too bad.'"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2420585953" "You know, you really don't have a lot to bargain with here."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2200373337" "Sharkhead's contracts are in our hands.  Bargaining is a waste of time.  In or out?"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2833761747" "Look, I don't have all day here.  You're either interested or you're not.  There is no bargain.  There is buy or bye."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4285179515" "I don't know if you've noticed, but you're not the only buyer in this town."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P648842495" "You weren't invited to this little transaction!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2789624090" "Who do you think you are!?"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_CAGE_SELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1029447912" "What the--?  I can't believe you just walked in like you had no clue you'd get your head bashed in."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2598914010" "Just so we're clear.  Stiffing Arachnos is an immediate death sentence."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3107256613" "You're not the only dealer in Sharkhead, and my file has you marked as 'expendable.'  Now let's get to business."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2122027940" "You have a lot of courage for someone so close to death.  I think you need to remind yourself who you're talking to."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_ARACHNOS_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1095444967" "Before you continue, let me remind you that I can break you so badly that dental records will not identify you."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2830949241" "The Council does not negotiate."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3801085319" "I'll have to speak to my superiors about this."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2944921028" "Do not expect to bargain with the Council."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2423989515" "Don't disappointment.  Your feeble attempts at bargaining have made me less inclined to be generous."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_COUNCIL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3344795746" "A shrewd businessman you are not.  Close to dead, definitely.  Shrewd, not even close."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILY_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P402200853" "You're wasting our time."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILY_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3305556411" "You may hold the contracts, but you don't own Sharkhead."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILY_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1091665149" "You're trying to stiff the Family.  Unacceptable."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILY_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1191439175" "Okay it's like this, pal.  I don't really care WHAT kind of deal you got with anyone else.  You and me, we're gonna work together real nice.  That's not a request."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILY_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2690167919" "Mess with me and I have a vat of cement with your name on it."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDER_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1996518811" "We provide extra security, help us out here."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDER_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1137522858" "We patrol this area."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDER_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4287163657" "Do not get on our bad side."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDER_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2784448200" "Before you speak any further, let me remind you that we can attack from the skies."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYRAIDER_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2384306234" "Let me think about it."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3635887778" "Just keep an eye out.  That's what we're doing.  We're keeping an eye out."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712812018" "I have the walkie talkie because I am responsible.  When YOU are responsible, you can have the walkie talkie."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1406714609" "Shh, I'm talking here.  Sir?  Yes, we're clear here.  Out."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1565307929" "Whoa!  We're not alone!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4156427509" "Guys!  We're not alone here!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1202262966" "The fun just started!  Brute force is recommended!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P347245830" "Wonder what it is I'm looking for..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2157060443" "Huh...that's interesting."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1637055469" "What was that?"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2760423428" "Walking around at night with a flashlight.  I may as well have a sign over my head that says 'Shoot here!.'  Sheez."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920872594" "Hm...interesting."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2901585601" "Freeze!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1344921508" "Put your hands where I can see them!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1394314236" "Don't move!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_FLASHLIGHT_INSPECTION_ALERT_TEXT :
"P578314378" "Who goes there?"

// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1942188671" "I am so ready to shoot something.  Anything."
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1567164288" "Here's a tip.  If it moves...shoot it.  Ask your questions later."
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2211901105" "The great thing about being a private security company is that I get paid extra for headshots."

// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2729208748" "Time for some target practice!"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2590299211" "Ahhh...so now the fun starts!"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2851503018" "Yes!  About time!"
// SHARKHEAD_RIFLEMEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2137196141" "I've got a bullet with your name on it!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_STANDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2510177923" "Intruder!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_STANDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2343988834" "You're trespassing!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1642704230" "I don't have to remind you that if you neglect to keep your weapon clean, you could very well blow your own head off."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3919541469" "Don't forget to check your sights.  I saw some pretty shabby target scores last week."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1739816239" "I want you to be able to assemble and disassemble that weapon in less than a minute.  What I DON'T want is to hear you whining."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3034992208" "You're not even close to being done.  Take it apart again."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2819588721" "Lesson's over.  Now comes the test!"
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2214558657" "Use 'em if you got 'em ready!"

